{"id":"vod_bf_27326","vodId":"27326","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"青之驱魔师：京都不净王篇","name_cn":"青之驱魔师：京都不净王篇","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-28/9fa838bf30ddb2323c7fa72295d924ba.jpg"},"summary":"人类居住的“物质界”和恶魔居住的“虚无界”本来是互不干涉的两个次元，但是因为恶魔出于对物质的凭依，对物质界有了干涉。于是人类之中便有了驱除恶魔的“驱魔师”存在。　　魔神（撒旦）的孩子奥村燐，隐藏了自己的出身，决意成为驱魔师，前往正十字学园内部存在的驱魔师培训机构·驱魔补习班学习。在地之王袭击的时候，奥村燐魔神的私生子的事败露了。因为畏惧魔神的“蓝炎”，同伴们与奥村燐之间的距离……　　在那样的时候，学园最深部被封印了“不净王的左眼”被不明人员偷窃，奥村燐等人陷入到了无法预料的事态。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 11:08:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qingzhiqumoshijingdubujingwangpian/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qingzhiqum